{
  "_": "fake-ollama configuration. Every model the proxy can route to has a globally-unique composite id 'model@target', where 'target' is the name of the upstream / target entry below. Clients must request models by their composite id; bare model names are rejected with 400. The two exposed-models lists at the bottom decide which composite ids are visible on each user-facing surface.",

  "host": "127.0.0.1",
  "port": 21434,
  "advertised_version": "0.6.4",

